[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1200.71, "timestamp": "00:20:00", "text": "正确的。好吧，我把游戏搞无聊了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1203.669, "timestamp": "00:20:03", "text": "是啊，这太疯狂了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1207.669, "timestamp": "00:20:07", "text": "我努力让自己不要陷入……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1211.99, "timestamp": "00:20:11", "text": "花费这么多。但是也"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1215.669, "timestamp": "00:20:15", "text": "那种感觉，那种“啊”的感觉，你拥有的那种感觉"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1218.63, "timestamp": "00:20:18", "text": "抓住这一刻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1221.11, "timestamp": "00:20:21", "text": "有时。是的。我喜欢拥有它，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1223.35, "timestamp": "00:20:23", "text": "就像你明白的那样，那是多巴胺带来的快感，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1225.83, "timestamp": "00:20:25", "text": "我知道，就像我不太需要那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1227.83, "timestamp": "00:20:27", "text": "当时多巴胺就在那里，你知道的，为了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1234.23, "timestamp": "00:20:34", "text": "是的，它带来的多巴胺是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1236.149, "timestamp": "00:20:36", "text": "伟大的。说实话，我承认"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1238.95, "timestamp": "00:20:38", "text": "它很短。很短"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1247.51, "timestamp": "00:20:47", "text": "好的。哦，我在Steam上给你发了好友请求。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1249.51, "timestamp": "00:20:49", "text": "好的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1251.669, "timestamp": "00:20:51", "text": "好了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1253.75, "timestamp": "00:20:53", "text": "我认为我需要删除我的模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1256.789, "timestamp": "00:20:56", "text": "这。我的电脑带不动。我曾经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1259.909, "timestamp": "00:20:59", "text": "呃，你知道，那时候我们玩……分裂游戏"}]